spice
* Transistor
Q1 2 7 0 NPN

* Resistors
R1 8 7 R1_value
R2 7 0 R2_value

* Current Sources
I1 2 1 DC I_Bias
I2 0 4 DC I_Bias

* Nodes
* 1 = Positive reference for I_Bias at V+
* 2 = Collector of Q1, connected to I_Bias at V+
* 3 = Connection point for V_BB
* 4 = Negative reference for I_Bias at V-
* 5 = Node connecting R2 to ground
* 6 = Part of V_BB node
* 7 = Base of Q1
* 8 = Node between R1 and base of Q1

* Model
.model NPN NPN